# Starting inline, Ctrl+F into fullscreen while subagents are running,
# then back. The
# replayed transcript pushes the live panel down; no row of the panel may be
# left behind at its old position (a stray "gen-N ... ━━━" row under the
# prompt; toggleFullscreen's repaint), and the prompt and panel each appear
# once.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/tools-task-concurrent.yaml
@fixture testdata/behaviour/qa/model-roles-fast-heavy
@args --inline --permission-mode acceptEdits
@env HARNESS_FAUX_EXTRA_MODELS=faux-3

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE scout the upload path with three subagents
KEY enter
WAITFOR /subagents? running/ 20
KEY ctrl+f
WAITFOR /3 subagents? finished/ 20
SHOT fullscreen-done
EXPECT /scout the upload path with three subagents/
EXPECT_NOT /scout the upload path with three subagents[\s\S]*scout the upload path with three subagents/
EXPECT_NOT /(3 subagents? (running|finished))[\s\S]*3 subagents? (running|finished)/
KEY ctrl+f
WAIT 1
SHOT inline-again
EXPECT /All three scouted/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
